anation":"세：三","readings":[{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17194","senseId":"1","lemma":"세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"번째야.","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍；째：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7d3f1e161caf0a72","term":"지난주","zh":"上周","audio":"/audio/7d3f1e161caf0a7205ae.mp3","entryId":"58105","definition":"本周的前一周。","pronunciation":["지난주"]},{"id":"c74dcf5ee23c448d","term":"잇다","zh":"接续，维持，继承","audio":"/audio/c74dcf5ee23c448d7e09.mp3","entryId":"24748","definition":"不间断，继续保持。","pronunciation":["읻ː따"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"1bcc05bddb3c9e8c","term":"세","zh":"三","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3","entryId":"17194","definition":"三个的。","pronunciation":["세ː"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"次，遍","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"计算事情次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["번"]}],"audio":"/audio/b51a1349585f4412666e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.248,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58105","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.7281,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["继上周之后，今天已经是第三次了。","你最近好像经常看电影啊。","这次同学聚会上承奎能来吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你最近好像经常看电影啊。","这次同学聚会上承奎能来吗？","继上周之后，今天已经是第三次了。"],"answer":2}]}
